OL,3,GNEWSAResidents unconvinced new cameras
OL,4,Awill cut speeding
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents say they are '"cynical" as to
OL,7,Fwhether new automatic number plate
OL,8,Frecognition (ANPR) cameras - which are
OL,9,Freturning to a town 15 years after they
OL,10,Fwere scrapped - will stop drivers
OL,11,Fspeeding.
OL,13,FSwindon Borough Council, the first in
OL,14,FEngland to switch off all cameras
OL,15,Fclaiming they did not prevent
OL,16,Faccidents, has reinstalled them on Okus
OL,17,FRoad, Croft Road, Akers Way, Grange
OL,18,FDrive and Homington Avenue.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
