OL,3,GNEWSAResidents unconvinced new cameras
OL,4,Awill cut speeding
OL,5,
OL,6,FResident Victoria Hope said they
OL,7,F"probably won't be a deterrent" after a
OL,8,Ftrial was halted in June when the
OL,9,Fcouncil said no camera data had been
OL,10,Fcollected and Wiltshire Police told the
OL,11,FBBC no information had been shared.
OL,13,FThe council said getting the cameras
OL,14,Foperating was an "important step
OL,15,Fforward".
